sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Dispatch, process and commit one outcome
  accDescr: A reused confirmed producer drains durable dispatch intent. The worker verifies the retained source outside database connections, then atomically saves a fenced outcome, notification and delivery events.
  participant R as Job relay
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant W as Celery worker
  participant S as Source + provider
  R->>DB: 3 Read unsent outbox
  R->>Q: 4 Publish UUID<br/>Reused producer
  Q-->>R: Confirm
  R->>DB: Mark sent<br/>Drain next batch
  Q->>W: UUID delivery may repeat
  W->>DB: 5 Claim lease
  Note over W,S: Release DB before external I/O
  W->>S: Verify original / safety<br/>Parse or reuse extraction
  S-->>W: Bounded extracted text
  Note over S,W: Local: GET → ClamAV<br/>AWS: clean tag → GET
  W->>S: Converse: propose evidence
  S-->>W: Proposed quotes
  W->>W: Validate source + schema<br/>Calculate coverage
  W->>DB: 6 Lock owner stream<br/>→ document → job, verify live lease/source
  W->>DB: Commit report / notice / events<br/>Release admission
  Note over DB,W: I/O may repeat<br/>Stale claim cannot replace outcome
